---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout>
  <section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-6 pt-24">
    <p class="text-monolith-text-muted text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">Свяжитесь с нами</p>
    <h1 class="heading-xl mb-6 text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Контакты</h1>
    <div class="divider mx-auto"></div>
    <p class="text-monolith-text-secondary text-lg max-w-xl mb-8">
      Начните с Нулевого Дня. Закончите домом, который понимает вас без слов.
    </p>

    <div class="bg-monolith-surface border border-monolith-border p-8 max-w-lg w-full text-left space-y-6 mb-6">
      <div>
        <p class="text-monolith-text-muted text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Телефон</p>
        <a href="tel:+79615192400" class="text-white text-lg hover:text-monolith-accent-warm transition-colors">+7 (961) 519-24-00</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-monolith-text-muted text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-1">Email</p>
        <a href="mailto:celoe.remont@mail.ru" class="text-white text-lg hover:text-monolith-accent-warm transition-colors">celoe.remont@mail.ru</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="bg-monolith-surface border border-monolith-border p-8 max-w-lg w-full text-left space-y-6 mb-8">
      <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="5d4b4402-ac3b-4333-b5af-ca423b67ce5a">
      <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Заявка с сайта Целое">
      <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://celoe-remont.pages.dev/contacts?sent=true">
      <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" class="hidden" style="display:none;">
      
      <h3 class="font-display text-xl text-white mb-2">Запланировать Нулевой День</h3>
      <p class="text-monolith-text-muted text-sm mb-4">Оставьте контакты — мы перезвоним в течение часа.</p>
      
      <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Имя" required class="w-full bg-transparent border border-monolith-border px-4 py-3 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-monolith-accent-warm transition-colors" />
      <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Телефон" required class="w-full bg-transparent border border-monolith-border px-4 py-3 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-monolith-accent-warm transition-colors" />
      <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" class="w-full bg-transparent border border-monolith-border px-4 py-3 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-monolith-accent-warm transition-colors" />
      <textarea name="message" placeholder="Опишите ваш проект (необязательно)" rows="3" class="w-full bg-transparent border border-monolith-border px-4 py-3 text-white text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-monolith-accent-warm transition-colors resize-none"></textarea>
      <label class="flex items-start gap-2 text-monolith-text-muted text-xs cursor-pointer">
        <input type="checkbox" name="agree" required class="mt-0.5 accent-monolith-accent-warm" />
        <span>Я согласен на <a href="/privacy" class="text-monolith-accent-warm hover:underline">обработку персональных данных</a></span>
      </label>
      <button type="submit" class="btn-monolith w-full">Отправить</button>
    </form>
    
    <p id="success-msg" class="text-monolith-accent-warm text-sm hidden mb-12">Спасибо! Заявка отправлена. Мы свяжемся с вами в ближайшее время.</p>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<script>
  if (window.location.search.includes('sent=true')) {
    document.getElementById('success-msg').classList.remove('hidden');
    document.querySelector('form').style.display = 'none';
    window.history.replaceState({}, document.title, '/contacts');
  }
</script>